			</TRAN>
		</TRID_INFO>
		<TRIO_INFO>
			<TRAN name="obcpp_bsdy_017r" title="매매용 T+N 영업일조회" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="130" _ulen="102" >

CLND_CLS_CODE^달력구분코드^4^0^0^0^0^0^0
MANG_DATE^관리일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
